to cover these bundled resources.

This directory contains Spyder-specific YAML palette and semantic mappings.
It does not bundle the original Sublime Text theme files, application code,
icons, textures, or fonts. Intermediate widget shades, status ramps, group
fills, and help styles are adaptations for Qt/Spyder.
